      <h2 id="summary">In short</h2>
      <ul class="tick-list">
        <li>We ask only for what we need to understand your enquiry.</li>
        <li>We share your details with a professional only if you have agreed to that.</li>
        <li>We do not ask for passwords, OTPs, identity documents or financial records with an enquiry.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="who">Who is responsible for your details</h2>
      <p>AccountOrbit is owned by {{ site.owner.name }}. You can reach us on <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>.</p>
      <p>Privacy questions can be raised on the same number. {% pending "the operating entity and registered address, an email address, and the person who handles privacy requests and complaints." %}</p>

      <h2 id="collect">What we collect, and why</h2>
      <section class="data-table-wrap" tabindex="0" aria-label="Data collected, scrolls sideways on small screens">
        <table class="data-table">
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Detail</th><th scope="col">Needed?</th><th scope="col">Why we ask</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">Name</th><td>Yes</td><td>To know who we are speaking to</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Mobile number</th><td>Yes</td><td>To contact you about this enquiry</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Email</th><td>Optional</td><td>If you prefer email</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Type of help needed</th><td>Yes</td><td>To work out what kind of professional is relevant</td></tr>
